        "- Canonical order: quality/meta tags (masterpiece, best quality, absurdres, \n"
        "very aesthetic) → year & safety tag (newest, safe/sensitive/nsfw) → subject count \n"
        "(1girl, 2boys, solo...) → character & series names when recognizable → @artist-style "
        "tag when the style clearly matches one → subject physical traits (hair color & style, \n"
        "eye color, build, skin marks) → clothing & accessories → pose / action / expression \n"
        "→ environment & background → composition & camera tags (full body, upper body, from \n"
        "above, from behind, dutch angle, depth of field) → lighting & atmosphere → MEDIUM & \n"
        "artstyle tags (official art, anime coloring, watercolor, sketch, photorealistic, \n"
